# Krateo Blueprint — Azure [[.ServiceTitle]] [[.AsoKind]]

> Generated by `tools/asogen` from the Azure Service Operator `[[.AsoKind]]` CRD (`[[.Group]]`).

Provisions an Azure [[.ServiceTitle]] **[[.AsoKind]]** through
[Azure Service Operator](https://azure.github.io/azure-service-operator/). The chart renders a
native `[[.Group]]/[[.AsoVersion]]` `[[.AsoKind]]` resource; ASO reconciles it into the real
Azure resource and reports status back.

Once the `CompositionDefinition` is applied, every `[[.CompKind]]` Composition you create
becomes an Azure [[.AsoKind]].

This CRD serves **[[.ServedCount]]** versions upstream; this blueprint targets
`[[.AsoVersion]]`, the newest GA non-storage version.

## Prerequisites

- **Azure Service Operator installed** in the cluster — see
  [`../../../docs/installing-controllers.md`](../../../docs/installing-controllers.md).
- **Azure credentials configured** — Workload Identity (recommended) or a service-principal
  Secret. See [`../../../docs/authentication.md`](../../../docs/authentication.md).
- Krateo `core-provider` installed.

## Configuration

Composition `spec` fields **mirror the ASO [[.AsoKind]] spec**, including the required `owner`
reference and `location`. Full schema in [`chart/values.schema.json`](chart/values.schema.json).
The extra `credentialFrom` field sets the `serviceoperator.azure.com/credential-from` annotation;
leave it empty to inherit the credential from the namespace.

## How to install

```sh
kubectl create namespace [[.Namespace]]
kubectl apply -f compositiondefinition.yaml   # publishes the [[.CompKind]] type
kubectl apply -f customform.yaml              # optional: portal card + form
```

This publishes a `[[.CompKind]]` Composition type (`composition.krateo.io/[[.CompVersion]]`,
plural `[[.CompPlural]]`), pulling the chart from
`oci://ghcr.io/krateo-blueprints/charts/[[.ChartName]]`.

### Create a Composition

```yaml
apiVersion: composition.krateo.io/[[.CompVersion]]
kind: [[.CompKind]]
metadata:
  name: my-[[.Slug]]
  namespace: [[.Namespace]]
spec:
  credentialFrom: ""        # optional: a Secret name; empty inherits from the namespace
  owner:
    name: my-resource-group
  # ... [[.AsoKind]] spec fields (see values.schema.json)
```

### Check status

```sh
kubectl get [[.CompPlural]].composition.krateo.io -n [[.Namespace]]
kubectl get [[.AsoKindLower]]s.[[.Group]] -A
```
